# The packages owl/lreat.ofn is built from, one repo-relative path per line.
# A commit touching any of them has to leave the document current, so the
# pre-commit hook checks it.
#
# This list is not written by hand and must not be edited to make a failure go
# away: owl/affects_test.go derives the same set from `go list -deps lreat/owl`
# and fails when the two disagree. If an import is added to the generator, the
# test says so and this file is what to fix.
#
# core/need is here because the generator reaches it through core/entity, which
# is the kind of thing a hand-written list gets wrong.
core/belief
core/clock
core/entity
core/habit
core/need
core/ontology
owl
